- Shared writable infrastructure silently becoming agent
memory/coordination infrastructure.

- Capability composition: package-manager/network functions with
legitimate narrow purposes becoming general egress or communication
primitives.

- Peer-agent instruction inheritance: one agent=E2=80=99s discovery or clai=
med
